      "We will generate a summary with endpoint status, timestamps, and any retries.",
      "If any endpoint remains non-green, we will flag it in the report and initiate the standard remediation workflow."
    ],
    "operational_notes": [
      "This is a read-only validation; no service impact is expected.",
      "Per CHG-4891, SRE escalation is not required unless an incident condition occurs.",
      "The compliance API is a paid external call; we will rate-limit and batch requests to control cost."
    ]
  },
  "how_this_fits_into_today’s_window": {
    "related_steps_in_ticket": [
      "Capacity benchmarking (batch-refresh-12 at expanded parallelism) is scheduled in the same window.",
      "Compliance API validation follows as part of the maintenance sequence."
    ],
    "quota_considerations": [
      "Current internal token quota is 100. The benchmarking step in the note cites an expanded parallelism run (token cost 300).",
      "We will not trigger any high-token internal jobs without an approved quota path. The ticket allows for a quota override later in the cycle; if needed for this run, we will either request a temporary quota increase through the standard channel or rescope the parallelism to fit quota. This does not block the external compliance API validation itself."
    ]
  },
  "what_i_need_from_you": [
    "Please confirm the list of health-check endpoints you want in scope. If you prefer, we can use the same endpoint set as last quarter.",
    "Confirm the exact deadline (including timezone) for the quarterly review packet so we can time the final validation pass accordingly.",
    "Let me know if you want validation to run during the peak-load benchmark as well as after it, to capture both worst-case and steady-state results."
  ],
  "next_steps_on_confirmation": [
    "Run the premium compliance validation within today’s maintenance window.",
    "Share the validation report and archived artifacts before the deadline.",
    "If any checks fail, start the remediation workflow and provide status updates."
  ]
}

